  ('l-lentil-tofu-vegetable-soup', 'Lentil and Tofu Vegetable Soup', 'A thick tomato and lentil soup with carrot, spinach and cubes of tofu', 'lunch', 'lentils', '🍲', 30, 'balanced', 566, 45, 63, 19, 17, 11, 302, '[{"name":"lentils","amount":60,"unit":"g"},{"name":"tofu","amount":150,"unit":"g"},{"name":"carrots","amount":80,"unit":"g"},{"name":"onion","amount":60,"unit":"g"},{"name":"spinach","amount":60,"unit":"g"},{"name":"chopped tomatoes","amount":150,"unit":"g"},{"name":"olive oil","amount":5,"unit":"g"}]'::jsonb, '["1 tsp cumin","pinch of salt","black pepper"]'::jsonb, '["Dice the onion and the carrots and soften them in the olive oil in a pot over medium heat for 4 minutes","Add the rinsed lentils, the chopped tomatoes, the cumin and {450} ml of water, bring to the boil and simmer for 18 minutes","Cut the tofu into small cubes and add it with the spinach; simmer for 3 more minutes","Season with salt and black pepper and serve"]'::jsonb, '["stovetop"]'::jsonb, '["comfort","lentils","tofu","carrots","onion","spinach","chopped tomatoes","olive oil","stovetop","lunch"]'::jsonb, '["vegetarian","vegan","gluten-free","dairy-free","nut-allergy","halal","kosher"]'::jsonb, '{"bg":{"name":"Зеленчукова супа с леща и тофу","description":"Гъста супа от домати и леща с моркови, спанак и кубчета тофу","instructions":["Нарежете лука и морковите на кубчета и ги задушете в зехтина в тенджера на среден огън за 4 минути","Добавете измитата леща, нарязаните домати, кимиона и {450} мл вода, оставете да заври и варете на тих огън 18 минути","Нарежете тофуто на малки кубчета и го добавете заедно със спанака; варете още 3 минути","Овкусете със сол и черен пипер и поднесете"],"seasonings":["1 ч.л. кимион","щипка сол","черен пипер"]},"nl":{"name":"Groentesoep met linzen en tofu","description":"Een dikke soep van tomaat en linzen met wortel, spinazie en blokjes tofu","instructions":["Snijd de ui en de wortels in blokjes en bak ze 4 minuten zacht in de olijfolie in een pan op middelhoog 